{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play golf in a range of unconventional locations, aiming to rack up the highest score possible by hitting a variety of unique targets. Chain your shots to build up a score multiplier and beat the clock to set a new high score.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989430/extras/02a27178743442ae7171a9fb389a212c.avif?t=1766350852\" width=1560 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989430/extras/f14b9a156b5ff493d11c76b28ee9eeb7.poster.avif?t=1766350852\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989430/extras/f14b9a156b5ff493d11c76b28ee9eeb7.webm?t=1766350852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989430/extras/f14b9a156b5ff493d11c76b28ee9eeb7.mp4?t=1766350852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to land your ball on top of a skyscraper? Go for it! Then scale the side of it and hit your next shot. Climb apartment blocks and zipline between rooftops. Whether on foot or in a golf cart, every corner of the environment is yours to explore.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989430/extras/fcef0c55b39f9e9f3a2fd9f766c38527.avif?t=1766350852\" width=1560 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989430/extras/b5e473af21c78c8bfa3c86eeab1aaeb7.poster.avif?t=1766350852\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989430/extras/b5e473af21c78c8bfa3c86eeab1aaeb7.webm?t=1766350852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989430/extras/b5e473af21c78c8bfa3c86eeab1aaeb7.mp4?t=1766350852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t let the surroundings get in your way. Master rich swing mechanics to show off your skills. Curve shots around buildings or adjust your trajectory to escape difficult situations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989430/extras/e0f1a7e3b101262f396ee861ee0d7c1d.avif?t=1766350852\" width=1560 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989430/extras/f2aec6caa578dcbfe05c718ad5196484.poster.avif?t=1766350852\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989430/extras/f2aec6caa578dcbfe05c718ad5196484.webm?t=1766350852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989430/extras/f2aec6caa578dcbfe05c718ad5196484.mp4?t=1766350852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take aim at a variety of risk vs reward targets. Couple this with the shot multiplier, that increases the longer the ball stays in the air, and you have the chance to pull of the spectacular shots when it matters the most</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989430/extras/dc7a8f3c8668c7393326bcbcf16aa5ff.avif?t=1766350852\" width=1560 height=120 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989430/extras/9ddfd03b9505ca3155890acae6e37eff.poster.avif?t=1766350852\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989430/extras/9ddfd03b9505ca3155890acae6e37eff.webm?t=1766350852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989430/extras/9ddfd03b9505ca3155890acae6e37eff.mp4?t=1766350852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level hides collectables and power ups. Collect them to complete objectives, unlock new levels, or give your next shot a serious boost</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989430/extras/9ea59d0d4ac4735265eca72d9464e24b.avif?t=1766350852\" width=1560 height=120 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989430/extras/a8cfc4f7780d32bb587bc622ac61fd39.poster.avif?t=1766350852\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989430/extras/a8cfc4f7780d32bb587bc622ac61fd39.webm?t=1766350852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989430/extras/a8cfc4f7780d32bb587bc622ac61fd39.mp4?t=1766350852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the best part? Every shot you take and every target you hit is recorded, building a complete replay of your game. Challenge other players\u2019 replays in your own session. Watch their shots play out in real time, then see if you\u2019ve got what it takes to beat their score.</p>","bac